deno_core 0.411.0: errno on Android and iOS.

uv_compat/tty.rs reads errno through a per-platform extern and has a
compile_error!() for every OS but macOS and Linux. iOS uses Darwin's __error();
Android's bionic exposes __errno().

diff -ruN a/uv_compat/tty.rs b/uv_compat/tty.rs
